		(property "Note" "Level-shifts GPIO24 up to Q2's gate; sinks only ~109 uA. Logic-level part, fully on at Vgs = 3.3V. R15 pulls its gate down so it is off whenever the Pi is not actively driving GPIO24 high - that is what makes sniff mode the default."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
