		(property "Note" "GPIO24 pull-down. Holds Q3 off whenever the Pi's GPIO is high-Z - off, booting, or crashed - so the K-line pull-up defaults to disconnected and the board cannot perturb an NT510/UpRev session it is only meant to be sniffing. Safety-relevant despite being a plain resistor."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
