		(property "Note" "TLIN1027 EN pull-down. THIS WAS DEFECT 2 IN S8.1: it originally pulled EN UP TO +12V, violating the part's +/-6V VLOGIC absolute maximum, inverting the intended default so the transceiver was permanently enabled, and pushing ~1.8 mA through the Pi's GPIO26 clamp into a rail that is down in HAT+ STANDBY. It is now a pull-DOWN to GND, backing the part's own internal pull-down so the transceiver defaults to low-power. Do not re-point this to a rail."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
