		(property "Note" "K-line pull-up gate divider, low leg. With R13 100k, pulls Q2's gate to 12 x 10/110 = 1.09V when Q3 conducts, giving Vgs = -10.9V. The 10:1 ratio is the mechanism: R13 wins when nothing pulls, R14 wins when Q3 is on. Divider draws ~109 uA, and only while commander mode is active - in sniff mode the circuit draws zero."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
