		(property "Note" "K-line TXD pull-up to +3V3, on the Pi side of R6. Guards a failure R6 alone does not cover: TXD is internally pulled to ground, so with EN already raised, a collector that dies or releases the tty would leave the vehicle's K-line held DOMINANT. Idle-recessive is the safe state."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
