		(property "Note" "Q2 gate pull-up. Defines the OFF state of the K-line commander pull-up: without it the P-FET gate would float when Q3 is off, and a floating gate is undefined. Not a bias resistor - it is what makes 'off' deterministic, which is what gives sniff-mode-by-default with the Pi unpowered."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
